# E. Kohlberg, "Invariant Half-Lines" (1980)

Bibliography label: Kohlberg 1980.

Published source: E. Kohlberg, *Invariant half-lines of nonexpansive
piecewise-linear transformations*, Mathematics of Operations Research 5(3)
(1980), 366--372. DOI: `10.1287/moor.5.3.366`.

The paper proves an invariant-half-line theorem for nonexpansive
piecewise-linear self-maps of finite-dimensional real space and derives the
common asymptotic drift of their iterates. It is relevant to finite global
operators assembled from nonexpansive piecewise-affine stopping maps, not to
arbitrary typed directed transport with unrelated fibers.

This file is a source-positioning note. It states no Lean version of the
invariant-half-line theorem.
-/

